# Packages published by the zbd repository. Dependencies are resolved automatically, so only
# the things a user would actually ask for belong here.
#
# A `# category:` line opens a section. The category travels into the index and is what the
# watch groups by — a flat list of a hundred names is unusable on a screen that fits six rows,
# so every entry below has to sit under a heading.
#
# Watch storage is the budget. Packages over ~40 MB stay out by default; vim and the explicitly
# requested development toolchains below are deliberate exceptions.

